#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your vote is on another copy of this Space, or it can't change any more."
msgstr "Vaš glas je na drugi kopiji tega prostora, ali pa se ne more več spremeniti."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "You’re all caught up"
msgstr "Vsi ste ujeti"

#, machine, plain1
